# Solver state, simulated paths, and MATLAB scratch. A production solve writes
# tens of megabytes per scenario; none of it belongs in git.
*.mat
*.asv
*.mex*

# Captured run output. Every batch log and console capture in this project is
# a .txt (parfor worker warnings, suite runs, verification output); prose is
# .md, so nothing worth keeping is caught here.
*.txt
slurm-*.out

# Generated figures and tables. Every .png/.pdf/.csv the scripts emit is
# regenerable from a solved .mat; the CBS mortality table is an input, not an
# output, so it is the one exception.
*.png
*.pdf
*.csv
!CBSunisexmortality21-26.csv
